nt fields.  You are a software engineer by trade as well as an experienced engineering manager and leader with hands-on experience.  Proven experience designing microservices architectures using DDD principles: bounded contexts, aggregates, domain events, and anti-corruption layers.  Proficiency in one or more backend languages (Java / Spring / GoLang / Python / .NET) and one or more frontend frameworks (HTML5 / Angular / React). Experience with REST API design, event-driven systems, state management, and component-driven architecture.  Good object-oriented skills with strong familiarity of design patterns.  Hands-on Test Driven Development experience; able to author Unit, Integration and Functional Tests.  Solid understanding of cloud infrastructure and environment management across development, staging, and production including networking, scaling, and access control.  Hands-on familiarity with CI/CD pipelines — build, test, deploy automation, environment promotion strategies, and release management.  Familiarity with containerization and orchestration concepts (Docker, Kubernetes) and how they apply to multi-environment deployments.  Familiarity with database design, migrations, and multi-tenancy patterns.  Familiarity with observability and APM platforms.  Able to translate complex technical decisions and trade-offs clearly to engineering teams and non-technical stakeholders, and give and receive direct technical feedback during design and code reviews.  Good communication and client-facing skills; comfortable leading technical discussions, design reviews, and cross-team alignment sessions in cross-functional Agile/Scrum teams alongside backend engineers, SDET, UX, and product owners.  Proactively manages technical risk and escalates blockers with proposed solutions, not just pr","role_search":"Deep Learning Engineer"},{"title":"Jobsharyana.In Walk-in Drive","company":"Jobsharyana.In","location":"Raipur","source":"google_images","url":"https://jobsharyana.in/api